@host = http://localhost:5231

# Paste an id from the "List all books" response to run the requests that need an existing book.
@bookId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List all books
GET {{host}}/api/books
Accept: application/json

### Create a book
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Doktor Glas",
  "author": "Hjalmar Söderberg",
  "publishedDate": "1905-09-01"
}

### Missing required fields -> 400 with a message per field
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "publishedDate": "1905-09-01"
}

### Whitespace-only title -> 400, a blank title is still a missing title
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   ",
  "author": "Hjalmar Söderberg"
}

### Author sent as a JSON number -> 400 from the type system, before validation runs
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": 2342324
}

### Update a book that does not exist -> 404
PUT {{host}}/api/books/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Doktor Glas",
  "author": "Hjalmar Söderberg"
}

### Delete a book that does not exist -> 404
DELETE {{host}}/api/books/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Fetch a book that does not exist -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/books/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Only a title, no author -> 400 on the author field alone
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Doktor Glas"
}

### Title longer than 200 characters -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipiscing elit sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua ut enim ad minim veniam quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat",
  "author": "Karin Boye"
}

### Update an existing book with an empty title -> 400, validation runs on update too
### Set @bookId above first.
PUT {{host}}/api/books/{{bookId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "Karin Boye"
}

### Delete the same book twice -> 204, then 404
### Set @bookId above first, then send this twice.
DELETE {{host}}/api/books/{{bookId}}
